{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18311","headline":"酬蓝田崔丞立之咏雪见寄 · 韩愈","name":"酬蓝田崔丞立之咏雪见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"京城数尺雪，寒气倍常年。\n泯泯都无地，茫茫岂是天。\n崩奔惊乱射，挥霍讶相缠。\n不觉侵堂陛，方应折屋椽。\n出门愁落道，上马恐平鞯。\n朝鼓矜凌起，山斋酩酊眠。\n吾方嗟此役，君乃咏其妍。\n冰玉清颜隔，波涛盛句传。\n朝飧思共饭，夜宿忆同毡。\n举目无非白，雄文乃独玄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18311.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18311","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}